+5. **Immediate Client Revocation & Bulk Purge:** Administrators can revoke compromised OAuth clients or execute single-transaction bulk purges (`POST /api/v1/admin/oauth-clients/bulk-delete`) to remove hundreds of stale Dynamic Client Registration (DCR) clients without disrupting active client sessions.
