+### Recipe 3: Kubernetes Projected Service Account Token Configuration
+
+```bash
+# Obtain projected service account token from Kubernetes pod volume
+K8S_TOKEN=$(cat /var/run/secrets/tokens/kanban-audience)
+
+# Exchange projected token with 👍kanban
+RESPONSE=$(curl -sLS -X POST "https://kanban.example.com/oauth/token" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" \
+  -d "grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange" \
+  -d "subject_token=${K8S_TOKEN}" \
+  -d "subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:jwt" \
+  -d "audience=https://kanban.example.com/mcp/agent")
+
+ACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo "${RESPONSE}" | jq -r .access_token)
+```
